  "title": "Barbecued Beef Liver",
  "description": "Beef liver simmered in a sweet and tangy barbecue sauce will tempt the picky eaters in your family! Even our teenagers like this. Double the sauce ingredients if you wish to have extra to pour over noodles or rice.",
